  "body": [
    "Written by Backlinko Team",
    "7898 shares",
    "This is a complete list of recent affiliate marketing statistics every marketer needs to know.",
    "So if you want to find data and facts on:",
    "Affiliate marketing spending",
    "Affiliate marketing adoption",
    "Affiliate marketing return on ad spend",
    "Popular affiliate networks",
    "You’ll love the list of up-to-date stats on this page.",
    "Here’s a summary of what you’ll learn:",
    "Affiliate Marketing Spending Statistics",
    "Affiliate Marketing Usage and Performance Statistics",
    "Affiliate Networks Statistics",
    "In 2026, affiliate marketing is booming, with spending reaching new heights.",
    "This section presents key statistics to show just how much businesses are investing in this growing area, and what that means for the future of marketing.",
    "Worldwide annual spending on affiliate marketing is estimated to reach $16 billion in 2028 – eMarketer",
    "Annual affiliate marketing spending in the US alone was projected to reach $13.2 billion in 2026 – Statista",
    "Around one third (33%) of marketing professionals plan large increases for their affiliate marketing budget in the next 12 months. Overall, 62% of marketers plan to increase their affiliate marketing budget over the next 12 months – Gen3 Marketing",
    "6 in 10 brands say they are increasing their spending on affiliate commissions – Martech Record",
    "Affiliate marketing is now a cornerstone of digital marketing, with widespread adoption and proven effectiveness.",
    "This section highlights key statistics demonstrating its vital role for both advertisers and publishers in today’s market landscape.",
    "Survey data shows that 81% of advertisers and 84% of publishers use affiliate marketing – Rakuten",
    "On average, affiliate marketing brings a 12:1 return on ad spend (ROAS) – Rakuten",
    "In a survey of marketers, 50% of respondents say that affiliate marketing channels are “very effective” in terms of achieving business goals, which is behind social media advertising (61%) but above content marketing (46%) – Gen3 Marketing",
    "More than half of US and Canadian marketers leverage affiliate marketing for mid-funnel (consideration stage, 58%) and upper funnel awareness (56%). Only 32% of respondents claim to use affiliate marketing for the post-sale stage (retention and loyalty) – eMarketer",
    "More than half (58%) of US content creators reported affiliate commissions as their income source, making it the 2nd most popular income type for creators after sponsored content (82%) – eMarketer",
    "In the first half of 2023, influencers accounted for 58% of newly added publishers to the Awin network (global affiliate platform) – eMarketer",
    "In a survey of brands, 30% of companies reported that between 11% and 20% of their marketing-driven revenue was attributed to affiliate marketing. Here’s the exact breakdown: – Martech Record Share of revenue attributed to affiliate marketing Share of respondents 10-20% 30% 21-30% 38% 31-50% 20% Above 50% 6%",
    "Among publishers, half of the respondents say that over 51% of their publication’s revenue is from affiliate marketing. Here are the exact numbers: – Martech Record Share of revenue attributed to affiliate marketing Share of respondents 0-5% 17% 6-10% 8% 11-20% 6% 21-30% 3% 31-50% 13% Above 50% 50% Don’t know 3%",
    "Affiliate networks are a critical part of the affiliate marketing ecosystem, dominated by a few major players.",
    "Amazon Associates is the most popular affiliate network with a 46.68% market share, followed by Rakuten Affiliate Network (7.55%) and AWIN (7.19%). Top 5 leading affiliate networks combined have a 73.41% market share – Datanyze",
    "TikTok Shop (officially launched in September 2023) already has over 100,000 creators in its affiliate program – Modern Retail",
    "The top 5 largest affiliate networks combined have a user base of over 2 million connected affiliates – Statista",
    "When ranked by number of affiliates in the network, Amazon Associates leads the ranking with 900,000 affiliates, followed by ShareASale (700,000), Awin (225,000), Rakuten (150,000), and ClickBank (100,000) – Statista",
    "Conclusion",
    "We hope you enjoyed this list of affiliate marketing statistics.",
    "We regularly update this list of statistics, so feel free to check this page later for new insights.",
    "Backlinko is owned by Semrush. We’re still obsessed with bringing you world-class SEO insights, backed by hands-on experience. Unless otherwise noted, this content was written by either an employee or paid contractor of Semrush Inc.",
    "On This Page",
    "Affiliate Marketing Spending Statistics",
    "Affiliate Marketing Usage and Performance Statistics",
    "Affiliate Networks Statistics",
    "Get instant insights into strengths and weaknesses of your competitors or prospective customers with Semrush"
  ],
